### requests.http:

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Get all todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos

### 2. Create a new todo
# @name testTodo
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Test redis by adding a third new todo via VS Code REST Client"
}

### 3. Get a single todo by ID 
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{testTodo.response.body._id}}

### 4. Update a todo (mark as done / change text)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{testTodo.response.body._id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Test the update by Id route with VS Code REST Client",
  "done": true
}

### 5. Delete a todo by Id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{testTodo.response.body._id}}


// Note:
// # @name testTodo: comment directive that captures the response object from the request block.
// testTodo.response.body._id: extracts the id from the response object.

### 6. Redis: Get usage statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/statistics